              "text": "सान्निध्यम् — sānnidhyam — \"nearness; presence\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मातुः सान्निध्ये शिशुः शान्तः भवति। mātuḥ sānnidhye śiśuḥ śāntaḥ bhavati. In its mother's presence the baby is calm."
